flowchart TB
  Upload[Owned TXT or PDF upload] --> Parse[Validate and extract text]
  Parse --> Chunk[Bounded chunking]
  Chunk --> Embed[Versioned lexical embeddings - 256]
  Embed --> PG[(pgvector storage)]
  Question[User question] --> Query[Query embedding]
  Query --> Retrieve[Owner and version filtered retrieval]
  PG --> Retrieve
  Retrieve --> Context[Untrusted attributed context]
  Context --> Adapter[Shared model adapter]
  Adapter --> Answer[Answer and persisted sources]
  Semantic[Semantic adapters - Workers AI staging verified] -. optional replacement .-> Embed
